      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ICEBERG AHEAD (1) missed the frame last time, finishing 4th (19.98) last time in a Grade 5 at Bulli. Has won here at this journey. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Can bounce back. WELL KEPT SECRET (4) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a strong early split, giving a sight but fading only late to finish second (23.09) at this track over 401m. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Expected to be in the finish again. SECRET BULLET (2) pinged the lids and was in the firing line throughout but drifted out of it when 7th at this track in a Grade 5. Has a good record here at this journey. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Key runner on best form. LIZZY BONKERS (3) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
